## Execution
Runs: batch

Expected wall time: < 5 minutes (actual compute ~1-2 minutes for 6 samples and 200 genes; queue time varies)
Expected output size: < 1 MB (PDF ~100 KB, CSV ~5 KB)
Memory required: < 500 MB (pandas dataframes and scikit-learn models are lightweight for this data size)

All execution through the workspace's configured scheduler (Slurm on this cluster). Python script will run in the `gars-bio` environment with pandas 3.0.5, numpy 2.5.2, scikit-learn 1.9.0, matplotlib 3.11.1 available.
